# Environment Variables for Cloud Run Deployment
# Copy this file to .env.cloudrun and fill real values. NEVER commit .env.cloudrun.
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PILOT ONE PATH — tired-human checklist (fill secrets, validate, deploy)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy only this block into .env.cloudrun first. Everything below is appendix.
#
# ENV=prod
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PRODUCT_ONLY=1
#
# SERVICE_RECORD_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASS@HOST:5432/DBNAME
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_DB_PRIMARY_READS=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_DB_PRIMARY_WRITES=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_JSON_CASE_WRITES=0
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_JSON_READ_FALLBACK=0
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PG_DUAL_WRITE=0
#
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_INTAKE_API_KEY=<24+ char random — broker-facing API>
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_SUPPORT_API_KEY=<24+ char random — support export (must differ)>
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=<OpenAI dashboard — required for LLM triage quality>
#
# Qdrant optional for intake SaaS (notice/knowledge wedge — omit when vectors not needed):
# QDRANT_URL=https://your-cluster.us-east4-0.gcp.cloud.qdrant.io
# QDRANT_API_KEY=<Qdrant Cloud dashboard — required when QDRANT_URL is cloud>
# QDRANT_COLLECTION=auto_insurance_demo_core
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_INTAKE_CORE_READINESS=1   # set by deploy_paid_pilot.sh; /readyz OK without Qdrant
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-ui.vercel.app,https://ui-XXXXXXXX-your-team.vercel.app
#
# PILOT_DEPLOY_STRICT=1
# Validate: PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/validate_pilot_deploy_env.py --env-file .env.cloudrun
# Profile:  PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/validate_pilot_deploy_env.py --show-profile
# Deploy:   bash scripts/deploy_paid_pilot.sh
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LOCAL RECOMMENDED — founder laptop / trial prep
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# run_demo_local.sh defaults to this posture unless RUN_DEMO_LAB=1 (explicit lab opt-in).
# Intake triage works without Qdrant when intake-core readiness is on.
# Add overrides to .env only when you need something different.
#
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PRODUCT_ONLY=1          # set automatically by run_demo_local.sh
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_INTAKE_CORE_READINESS=1 # set automatically by run_demo_local.sh
# SERVICE_RECORD_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://...   # when testing PG locally
#
# Lab / SearchForge RAG experiments (NOT paid pilot):
#   RUN_DEMO_LAB=1 bash scripts/run_demo_local.sh
#   → platform_full routers, /api/query, optional Qdrant for /demo page
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Runtime authority (anti-drift):
# - Backend: `bash scripts/deploy_paid_pilot.sh` → `deploy_cloud_run_core.sh` reads THIS file.
# - Frontend: Vercel `VITE_API_BASE_URL` + `VITE_UNIFIED_INTAKE_PRODUCT_ONLY=1`
# - CORS: ALLOWED_ORIGINS must list every real browser Origin (alias + ui-*.vercel.app).
#
# Usage:
#   cp configs/demo.env.example .env.cloudrun
#   bash scripts/deploy_paid_pilot.sh          # paid broker pilot
#   bash scripts/deploy_demo_cloud_smoke.sh    # legacy demo cloud only (DEMO_MODE)

# =============================================================================
# PILOT ONE PATH — active values (uncomment / fill for .env.cloudrun)
# =============================================================================

# --- Postgres (required paid pilot) ---
# SERVICE_RECORD_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASS@HOST:5432/DBNAME
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_DB_PRIMARY_READS=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_DB_PRIMARY_WRITES=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_JSON_CASE_WRITES=0
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_JSON_READ_FALLBACK=0
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PG_DUAL_WRITE=0

# --- Product surface ---
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PRODUCT_ONLY=1
# ENV=prod
# PILOT_DEPLOY_STRICT=1

# --- API perimeter (required paid pilot) ---
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_INTAKE_API_KEY=
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_SUPPORT_API_KEY=

# --- LLM triage ---
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Qdrant (optional — notice/knowledge wedge; omit for intake-only SaaS deploy) ---
# QDRANT_URL=https://your-qdrant-instance.com:6333
# QDRANT_API_KEY=
# QDRANT_COLLECTION=auto_insurance_demo_core

# --- CORS (required when UI on Vercel) ---
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://ui-smoky-beta.vercel.app,https://ui-XXXXXXXX-andys-projects-1f411b73.vercel.app

# =============================================================================
# OPTIONAL — safe tuning (pilot may set; not in minimum tuple)
# =============================================================================

# LLM generation flag (usually implied when OPENAI_API_KEY is set)
# LLM_GENERATION_ENABLED=1

# Add-Car pilot parity (keep LOCAL / STAGING / PROD identical for these three)
ENABLE_ASSIST_LAYER=1
DEBUG_TRUTH_GUARDRAILS=0
ADD_CAR_CONTRACT_STRICT=0
# ASSIST_LAYER_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Intake-core readiness: /readyz treats Qdrant/embedding as optional when product_only=1.
# deploy_paid_pilot.sh sets this automatically. Override only for full-stack RAG deploy.
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_INTAKE_CORE_READINESS=1

# Pilot token scope labels (manifest hints only — not IAM)
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_EXPECTED_OFFICE_SLUGS=main-street-office,downtown-office
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_DEPLOY_BROKER_LABEL=chen-kui-pilot

# Abuse safety — coarse triage POST throttle per IP
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_TRIAGE_POST_MAX_PER_MINUTE_PER_IP=120

# Office ownership boundary (multi-office pilot)
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_ENFORCE_CASE_OFFICE_OWNERSHIP=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_OFFICE_LIST_STRICT_NO_LEGACY=1

# =============================================================================
# DEV ONLY — local founder demo (never on paid pilot / ENV=prod)
# =============================================================================

# DEMO_MODE=true — Relaxes /readyz (Qdrant/embedding optional). Local + demo cloud smoke only.
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_CASES_PATH=data/demo_cases.json
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_ALLOW_INMEMORY_SESSIONS_FOR_TESTS=1

# =============================================================================
# LAB ONLY — SearchForge R&D / experiments (hidden when PRODUCT_ONLY=1)
# =============================================================================

# V6 Automatic Input (OCR)
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_API_KEY=
# V6_AUTO_INPUT_VARIANT=B
# V6_OCR_FORCE_STUB=1
# V6_OCR_STUB_TEXT="VIN 1HGCM82633A004352 ZIP 92602"

# =============================================================================
# LEGACY — compatibility paths (do not enable on paid pilot)
# =============================================================================

# JSON dual-write / read fallback (validators fail if on with prod-like flags)
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_PG_DUAL_WRITE=1
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_JSON_READ_FALLBACK=1

# =============================================================================
# INTERNAL — deploy plumbing, observability, integrations
# =============================================================================

# --- GCP overrides ---
# PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
# REGION=us-central1

# --- Cloud Run sizing (deploy_cloud_run_core.sh) ---
# CLOUD_RUN_MEMORY=1Gi
# CLOUD_RUN_CONCURRENCY=30
# CLOUD_RUN_MIN_INSTANCES=0
# CLOUD_RUN_MAX_INSTANCES=2

# --- Secret Manager (production) ---
# CLOUD_RUN_USE_SECRET_MANAGER=1
# CLOUD_RUN_SECRET_QDRANT=fiqa-qdrant-api-key
# When live service binds secrets, deploy MUST use CLOUD_RUN_USE_SECRET_MANAGER=1.

# --- Minimal signed broker token (HMAC — pilot lineage, NOT enterprise IAM) ---
# SSOT: docs/sprints/archive/MINIMAL_SIGNED_BROKER_TOKEN_SPRINT.md
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_BROKER_TOKEN_HMAC_SECRET=
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_BROKER_TOKEN_DEPLOY_BINDING=
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_BROKER_TOKEN_MAX_CLOCK_SKEW_SEC=120

# --- Unified Intake storage overrides ---
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_CASES_PATH=data/demo_cases.json

# --- Observability ---
# OBS_ENABLED=0
# LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=sk-...
# LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk-...
# LANGFUSE_HOST=https://cloud.langfuse.com

# --- WeChat optional binding ---
# WECHAT_APP_ID=
# WECHAT_APP_SECRET=
# WECHAT_BINDING_REDIRECT_URI=https://your-api.run.app/api/inbox/wechat/binding/callback
# PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.run.app
# API_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-api.run.app
# UNIFIED_INTAKE_FRONTEND_ORIGIN=https://your-app.vercel.app
# WECHAT_BINDING_PEPPER=
# WECHAT_BINDING_STATE_SECRET=
# WECHAT_BINDING_ALLOW_SIMULATE=0
# CLIENT_ID=socal_precision

# --- Qdrant Cloud setup notes (operator) ---
# 1. Cluster URL + API key from Qdrant Cloud dashboard
# 2. python scripts/verify_qdrant_cloud.py
# 3. python scripts/migrate_local_qdrant_to_cloud.py --cloud-url $QDRANT_URL --cloud-api-key $QDRANT_API_KEY

# --- ALLOWED_ORIGINS operator notes ---
# Founder bookmark: https://ui-smoky-beta.vercel.app/workbench/unified-intake
# After `cd ui && vercel ls`, add every hostname brokers might open.
# If unset in .env.cloudrun: deploy may omit ALLOWED_ORIGINS → permissive demo CORS (not for locked prod).
